cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Relic: Runtime Governance and Longitudinal Modeling for Reflective Agents"
abstract: >
  Relic is a runtime governance and longitudinal modeling layer for conversational
  agents. It captures behavioral signals from interaction, maintains evolving
  subject profiles under privacy and provenance constraints, and produces
  inspectable runtime context for a diegetic relational agent (Gumi). The facet
  model is grounded in cognitive appraisal theory, self-determination theory,
  attachment theory, dual-process theory, CAPS, and LIWC.
authors:
  - alias: yuzushi-dev
repository-code: "https://github.com/yuzushi-dev/Relic"
